If you get tired&nbsp;sitting in front of Zoom for eight hours a day,

00:13:06.097 --> 00:13:08.047
violin gets tired being in the case.

00:13:08.047 --> 00:13:09.618
I feel&nbsp;like I need to exercise my body,

00:13:09.618 --> 00:13:12.657
or I'm gonna end up becoming that violin that just...

00:13:12.657 --> 00:13:14.418
...hasn't&nbsp;been exercised.

00:13:15.127 --> 00:13:16.160
Stuck.

